{"verse_key": "10:61", "surah": 10, "verse": 61, "text_uthmani": "وَمَا تَكُونُ فِى شَأْنٍ وَمَا تَتْلُوا۟ مِنْهُ مِن قُرْءَانٍ وَلَا تَعْمَلُونَ مِنْ عَمَلٍ إِلَّا كُنَّا عَلَيْكُمْ شُهُودًا إِذْ تُفِيضُونَ فِيهِ ۚ وَمَا يَعْزُبُ عَن رَّبِّكَ مِن مِّثْقَالِ ذَرَّةٍ فِى ٱلْأَرْضِ وَلَا فِى ٱلسَّمَآءِ وَلَآ أَصْغَرَ مِن ذَٰلِكَ وَلَآ أَكْبَرَ إِلَّا فِى كِتَـٰبٍ مُّبِينٍ", "translation": "And, [O Muḥammad], you are not [engaged] in any matter and do not recite any of the Qur’ān and you [people] do not do any deed except that We are witness over you when you are involved in it. And not absent from your Lord is any [part] of an atom's weight<sup foot_note=196451>1</sup> within the earth or within the heaven or [anything] smaller than that or greater but that it is in a clear register.", "verse_from_ms": 1373760, "verse_to_ms": 1424620, "audio_url": "https://download.quranicaudio.com/qdc/khalifah_taniji/murattal/10.mp3", "words": [{"i": 0, "text": "وَمَا", "start_ms": 1373760, "end_ms": 1374710}, {"i": 1, "text": "تَكُونُ", "start_ms": 1374710, "end_ms": 1375600}, {"i": 2, "text": "فِى", "start_ms": 1375600, "end_ms": 1375960}, {"i": 3, "text": "شَأْنٍ", "start_ms": 1375960, "end_ms": 1377240}, {"i": 4, "text": "وَمَا", "start_ms": 1377240, "end_ms": 1377820}, {"i": 5, "text": "تَتْلُوا۟", "start_ms": 1377820, "end_ms": 1378670}, {"i": 6, "text": "مِنْهُ", "start_ms": 1378670, "end_ms": 1379260}, {"i": 7, "text": "مِن", "start_ms": 1379260, "end_ms": 1380180}, {"i": 8, "text": "قُرْءَانٍ", "start_ms": 1380180, "end_ms": 1381770}, {"i": 9, "text": "وَلَا", "start_ms": 1381770, "end_ms": 1382350}, {"i": 10, "text": "تَعْمَلُونَ", "start_ms": 1382350, "end_ms": 1383620}, {"i": 11, "text": "مِنْ", "start_ms": 1383620, "end_ms": 1383970}, {"i": 12, "text": "عَمَلٍ", "start_ms": 1383970, "end_ms": 1384860}, {"i": 13, "text": "إِلَّا", "start_ms": 1384860, "end_ms": 1385520}, {"i": 14, "text": "كُنَّا", "start_ms": 1385520, "end_ms": 1386680}, {"i": 15, "text": "عَلَيْكُمْ"